-- Marilyn concept card, written in godtongue.
-- The studded bezel style draws the frame; this file adds the photo, the lettering and the back.

create a card called marilyn, seed 19260601.
use the studded bezel style.

on the front.
use $studded-finish.
print @marilyn.jpg in the window, focused at 0.5 0.2.
spray the window with gloss, 30 µm thick.
write "fancard" called wordmark in Bodoni Moda italic, at 620 230, size 58.
sign "Marilyn" at 620 1478.
use $gild on the wordmark and the signature.

on the back.
use $studded-finish.
fill the window with damask.
sign "Marilyn" called back-signature, at 620 900, 680 wide, size 320.
inlay the damask except the back-signature grown by 18 with ivory, 0.015 mm deep.
use $gild on the wordmark and the back-signature.
